{"seq":1,"slug":"dsar-intake-identity-verification","title":"DSAR 请求类型、受理分流与身份核验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consent-preference-management-platform-privacy-dsar/dsar-governance-audit-ops/dsar-intake-identity-verification","wordCount":3117,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"dsar-请求类型-受理分流与身份核验\">DSAR 请求类型、受理分流与身份核验</h1><p>一个德国买家在客服工单里写「请把我所有的数据发给我」；同一周，一个加州用户点开了网站底部的「Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information」链接。这两件事在工单系统里都叫「用户请求」，但法律上分属不同权利通道、法定时限不同、所需身份核验强度也不同。塞进同一个 <code>handleUserRequest()</code> 函数是合规事故的标准开端。本文聚焦 DSAR（Data Subject Access Request，数据主体权利请求）链路最前段的两个门：<strong>请求归到哪一类权利</strong>，以及<strong>在把数据交出去之前，凭什么相信来的人就是本人</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个入口-多条权利通道-三项不可让步的性质\">核心概念：一个入口、多条权利通道、三项不可让步的性质</h2><p><strong>DSAR</strong> 本身不是一种权利，而是若干法定权利共用的受理外壳。同一个买家可能在 GDPR（欧盟《通用数据保护条例》Regulation (EU) 2016/679）第 15–22 条下拥有八项权利，在 CCPA/CPRA（加州《消费者隐私法》经 CPRA 修订，Cal. Civ. Code §1798.100 及以下）下拥有知道、删除、更正、退出出售/共享等权利，二者并不对应。受理层要把「用户说的那句话」映射成可执行的权利流水线。</p>\n<p>合格链路必须同时满足三项性质：<strong>可发现</strong>——GDPR 第 12(2) 条要求为行使权利提供便利，不得设隐性门槛；<strong>可核验</strong>——披露前确认请求者身份，过松会把数据交给攻击者，过严则构成对权利的实质阻碍；<strong>可证明</strong>——每次受理、核验、延期、拒绝都留时间戳与理由，与 <a href=\"../consent-model-legal-basis/consent-record-evidence-proof-chain\">同意记录与证据链</a> 同一套纪律。</p>\n<p>受理分流本质是一个映射函数。设原始文本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，映射到权利集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(r) \\subseteq \\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，再映射为流水线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi><mo>∣</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(r) = \\{ k \\in \\mathcal{R} \\mid \\mathrm{intent}(r, k) \\ge \\tau_k \\}, \\qquad P = \\mathrm{route}\\big(R(r), \\mathrm{jurisdiction}(u)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">intent</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">route</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">jurisdiction</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{jurisdiction}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">jurisdiction</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 取该用户的最终法域（与 <a href=\"../consent-capture-region-enforcement/region-rule-engine-geo-enforcement\">区域规则引擎</a> 的裁决同源）。<strong>关键约束：法域决定「这条权利是否存在」，而非「要不要处理这条请求」。</strong> 加州用户提出的 GDPR 式访问请求，应按美国口径回复等同内容，而不是回一句「我们不适用 GDPR」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求进入&lt;br/&gt;表单 / 邮件 / 工单 / 电话 / 代理] --&gt; B[渠道归一为工单对象]&#10;    B --&gt; C[意图识别&lt;br/&gt;规则 + 分类模型]&#10;    C --&gt; D{命中几条权利?}&#10;    D --&gt;|单条| E[单权利流水线]&#10;    D --&gt;|多条| F[拆分为子任务&lt;br/&gt;共享同一受理编号]&#10;    E --&gt; G{需要核验吗?}&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt;|登录态内自助| H[低强度核验]&#10;    G --&gt;|未登录 / 敏感数据| I[中高强度核验]&#10;    G --&gt;|代理请求| J[授权书核验]&#10;    H --&gt; K[启动法定时钟 T0]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L[履行 / 延期 / 拒绝 + 留证]\">graph TD\n    A[请求进入&lt;br/&gt;表单 / 邮件 / 工单 / 电话 / 代理] --&gt; B[渠道归一为工单对象]\n    B --&gt; C[意图识别&lt;br/&gt;规则 + 分类模型]\n    C --&gt; D{命中几条权利?}\n    D --&gt;|单条| E[单权利流水线]\n    D --&gt;|多条| F[拆分为子任务&lt;br/&gt;共享同一受理编号]\n    E --&gt; G{需要核验吗?}\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt;|登录态内自助| H[低强度核验]\n    G --&gt;|未登录 / 敏感数据| I[中高强度核验]\n    G --&gt;|代理请求| J[授权书核验]\n    H --&gt; K[启动法定时钟 T0]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L[履行 / 延期 / 拒绝 + 留证]</pre><h2 id=\"请求类型学-八类权利与它们的电商落点\">请求类型学：八类权利与它们的电商落点</h2><p>GDPR 第 15–22 条的权利清单是行业事实标准，其他法域大多照此裁剪。逐条落到跨境电商的数据面上，才能判断某条请求实际要动哪些系统。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权利</th>\n<th>GDPR 条</th>\n<th>CCPA/CPRA 对应</th>\n<th>电商数据落点</th>\n<th>需强核验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>访问（含副本）</td>\n<td>第 15 条</td>\n<td>Right to Know</td>\n<td>订单史、支付方式、地址簿、客服记录、画像标签</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更正</td>\n<td>第 16 条</td>\n<td>Right to Correct</td>\n<td>收货地址、姓名拼写、电话、生日</td>\n<td>依字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除 / 被遗忘</td>\n<td>第 17 条</td>\n<td>Right to Delete</td>\n<td>账户、评价、忠诚度积分、营销订阅</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限制处理</td>\n<td>第 18 条</td>\n<td>Limit Use of Sensitive PI</td>\n<td>争议订单冻结、精确定位停用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可携带</td>\n<td>第 20 条</td>\n<td>无精确对应</td>\n<td>结构化导出（JSON/CSV）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反对</td>\n<td>第 21 条</td>\n<td>Opt-out of Sale/Share</td>\n<td>直邮、广告画像、App 推送</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不受自动决策约束</td>\n<td>第 22 条</td>\n<td>ADMT 退出与访问</td>\n<td>风控拒单、动态定价</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤回同意</td>\n<td>第 7(3) 条</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>与 <a href=\"../consent-capture-region-enforcement/withdrawal-objection-signal-enforcement\">撤回与反对信号</a> 同通道</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两点容易被忽略。第一，<strong>反对与撤回同意不是同一件事</strong>：撤回同意撤的是「基于同意」的处理，反对（第 21 条）针对「基于正当利益」的处理。第二，<strong>可携带权（第 20 条）只覆盖「以自动化方式处理、且基于同意或合同」的数据</strong>，画像衍生标签通常不在其列——一股脑导出反而泄露不必要的内部推断。其他法域记住差异点即可：巴西 LGPD 第 18–19 条、中国《个人信息保护法》第 45、50 条、印度 DPDP Act 2023 第 11–14 条，共同点是<strong>都要求显式受理机制</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"受理分流-渠道归一-意图识别与跨账户归并\">受理分流：渠道归一、意图识别与跨账户归并</h2><p>请求从哪来，决定它有多容易被漏掉。中型跨境站点通常同时开着七八个入口：站内隐私表单、<code>privacy@</code> 邮箱、客服工单、电话录音、门店纸质表、平台站内消息、律师函。<strong>第一条纪律是渠道归一</strong>：所有入口必须落到同一工单对象、拿到同一个 <code>dsar_id</code>，否则「这个用户上个月其实提过」就无法证明。</p>\n<p>意图识别先用<strong>关键词规则</strong>兜住高频表达（中英德法西五语的「删除我的数据」「导出我的信息」「不要卖我的数据」），再用分类模型处理长尾，都不确定就进人工队列而不是猜。结果落到四档：<strong>可自动履行</strong>（退出出售/共享、撤回营销同意）、<strong>需人工履行</strong>（访问、可携带、删除）、<strong>需澄清</strong>（意图模糊，澄清可暂停时钟）、<strong>需拒绝或部分拒绝</strong>（豁免、明显无根据或过度）。</p>\n<p>跨账户归并是电商特有的难点，且<strong>同时是隐私风险</strong>。一个自然人常有多个账户（游客下单的手机号、注册账户、忠诚度账户），合并才能给出完整答复，但合并动作本身就在建立人身份图谱。工程折中是<strong>只在本次请求范围内临时归并</strong>，用邮箱、已验证手机号、订单号作匹配键，结果只作工单临时字段，不写回主数据、不产出持久身份映射表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"身份核验-在过度收集与披露失控之间取阈\">身份核验：在过度收集与披露失控之间取阈</h2><p>核验是链路上唯一「做错哪一边都算错」的环节。核验过严（索要身份证、护照扫描件）违反 GDPR 第 5(1)(c) 最小化原则，并把控制者自己变成高价值证件库；过松则等于把账户数据批量交给任何知道目标邮箱的人。GDPR 第 12(6) 条与第 11(2) 条给出方向：可要求补充信息确认身份，<strong>但只在存在真实疑虑（reasonable doubts）时</strong>；EDPB《Guidelines 01/2022 on data subject rights – right of access》（2023 定稿）明确不得以核验为名索取超出必要范围的信息。工程上按<strong>披露内容的敏感度</strong>分级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n<th>核验手段</th>\n<th>反例（禁止）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 会话内自助</td>\n<td>已登录且同会话查看/导出自己的数据</td>\n<td>复用现有登录态</td>\n<td>再要求答密保问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 弱核验</td>\n<td>未登录，请求低敏感项（订阅偏好、退出出售）</td>\n<td>邮箱回信确认 + 验证码，直接生效</td>\n<td>要求订单号才能退订</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 中核验</td>\n<td>访问/删除/更正非敏感数据面</td>\n<td>OTP + 两个数据点匹配（订单号、收货邮编、卡尾号后四位）</td>\n<td>索取完整卡号用于比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 强核验</td>\n<td>可携带导出、敏感 PI、ADMT 访问、疑似盗号</td>\n<td>L2 + 二次因子 + 人工复核，结合登录风控评分</td>\n<td>默认流程索要证件扫描件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 代理请求</td>\n<td>律师、亲属、监护、授权代理</td>\n<td>授权书 + 被代理人本人确认</td>\n<td>仅凭声称有授权的邮件放行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>加州口径给了可直接抄的量化锚点：CCPA 实施细则要求「合理确信」通常匹配 <strong>2 个</strong>数据点，「高度合理确信」通常匹配 <strong>3 个</strong>，具体信息（specific pieces of PI）的访问与删除适用后者。这是<strong>下限而非上限</strong>——数据点数量只是可审计的近似。</p>\n<p>核验阈值可以写成一次期望损失最小化。设攻击者为真实主体的先验概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，错误拒绝率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{FRR}(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FRR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与错误接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{FAR}(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FAR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的单位损失分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（监管风险）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（数据泄露，通常高两个数量级），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^{*} = \\arg\\min_{\\theta} \\; L(\\theta) = p \\cdot c_{r} \\cdot \\mathrm{FRR}(\\theta) + (1-p) \\cdot c_{f} \\cdot \\mathrm{FAR}(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5021em;vertical-align:-0.7521em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FRR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FAR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_f \\gg c_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最优阈值天然偏向严格侧——但<strong>只对高敏感披露严格</strong>：L3 宁可多一点人工复核，L1 绝不允许加门槛。一个必须显式防御的场景是<strong>账号接管后的 DSAR 提取</strong>：攻击者拿到账户后不逐页扒数据，而是提交「导出我的全部数据」，把系统自己的合规流水线当外泄工具。防御与登录风控同源——提交 DSAR 时读取会话风险评分，异常时降级人工复核并通知账户所有者备用联系方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时限时钟-延期与拒绝写法\">时限时钟、延期与拒绝写法</h2><p>法定时限不能靠工程优化绕开，必须由系统而非人脑守。GDPR 第 12(3) 条要求<strong>一个月内</strong>答复，复杂请求可再延两个月，但延长必须在一个月内告知并说明理由。CCPA 侧另有两套数字：<strong>45 天</strong>内答复，可再延 45 天（合计最多 90 天），并应在收到后 <strong>10 个工作日</strong>内确认收悉；知情权带 <strong>12 个月</strong>回溯窗口。</p>\n<p>时钟起点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与暂停规则最容易分歧。可固定的口径是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>due</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>jurisdiction</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>收到可执行请求之日（含澄清完成之日）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{due}} = T_0 + \\Delta_{\\text{jurisdiction}}, \\qquad T_0 = \\text{收到可执行请求之日（含澄清完成之日）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">due</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">jurisdiction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收到可执行请求之日（含澄清完成之日）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>英国 ICO 的 DSAR 指引支持「停表」（stop the clock）：需要向请求者澄清身份或补充定位信息时，时钟在等待期暂停——<strong>前提是控制者必须主动、及时索取</strong>，被动等待不算。系统要实现的是一个有时限的澄清循环：发出澄清 → 暂停 → 用户回复 → 恢复，两次都留时间戳。</p>\n<p>费用与过度请求是同一枚硬币的两面。GDPR 第 12(5) 条规定，对<strong>明显无根据或过度（manifestly unfounded or excessive）<strong>的请求，尤其是重复请求，可收取合理费用或拒绝处理，并对「过度」负举证责任；第 15(3) 条明确</strong>首份副本免费</strong>。工程上把「过度」做成有证据的规则而非客服感觉：12 个月内请求次数、是否已被同一权利答复过、是否明显为批量骚扰——任一成立才进入过度审查，结论写入工单留证。</p>\n<p>多数 DSAR 的正确结局不是「全给」也不是「拒绝」，而是<strong>部分披露</strong>。豁免侧，GDPR 第 15(4) 条明确访问权不得影响他人权利与自由，法律职业特权、犯罪预防、商业秘密都可能构成豁免；遮蔽侧，订单数据天然带着别人（共同收货人、礼品收件人、同地址家庭成员），披露前必须逐字段遮蔽第三方 PII，这与 <a href=\"../preference-center-suppression-sync/suppression-list-downstream-sync\">抑制名单的下游同步</a> 是同一类「一个对象承载多方数据」的问题；拒绝写作侧，答复必须写明理由、条文明细与救济途径（GDPR 第 77 条投诉权、第 79 条司法救济权）。</p>\n<p>跨境冲突按「并集最严」处理：请求同时落在两个法域时按最严一侧履行；仅在加州成立的请求不应被强行套用 GDPR 豁免清单。每次拒绝、部分披露或延期，都要能解释清楚是对谁、在哪个法域、依据哪一条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DSAR 是多种法定权利共用的受理外壳；受理层先做请求文本到权利集合的映射，再由法域裁决决定该权利是否存在。</li>\n<li>三项不可让步的性质：可发现、可核验、可证明。任一缺失都会被解读为设置权利障碍。</li>\n<li>权利必须逐条落到数据面（订单、支付、画像、客服、忠诚度）；反对（正当利益）与撤回同意（同意）走不同下游路径。</li>\n<li>渠道归一成单一 <code>dsar_id</code> 是防漏前提；跨账户归并只在请求范围内临时做，不产出持久身份映射。</li>\n<li>身份核验按披露敏感度分级（L0–L4），而非按「客服觉得像不像」；索要证件扫描件是反模式。</li>\n<li>时限由系统守：GDPR 一个月（可延两个月）、CCPA 45 天（可延至 90 天，10 个工作日确认收悉，12 个月回溯）；澄清期可停表但须主动索取并留时间戳。账号接管后的 DSAR 提取是真实攻击面，合规流水线必须接安全前置信号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DSAR 请求类型、受理分流与身份核验","id":"dsar-请求类型-受理分流与身份核验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个入口、多条权利通道、三项不可让步的性质","id":"核心概念-一个入口-多条权利通道-三项不可让步的性质"},{"level":2,"text":"请求类型学：八类权利与它们的电商落点","id":"请求类型学-八类权利与它们的电商落点"},{"level":2,"text":"受理分流：渠道归一、意图识别与跨账户归并","id":"受理分流-渠道归一-意图识别与跨账户归并"},{"level":2,"text":"身份核验：在过度收集与披露失控之间取阈","id":"身份核验-在过度收集与披露失控之间取阈"},{"level":2,"text":"时限时钟、延期与拒绝写法","id":"时限时钟-延期与拒绝写法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同步一致性、冲突解决与故障恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consent-preference-management-platform-privacy-dsar/preference-center-suppression-sync/sync-consistency-conflict-recovery"},"next":{"title":"DSAR 履行编排、下游系统联动与 SLA 管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consent-preference-management-platform-privacy-dsar/dsar-governance-audit-ops/dsar-fulfillment-orchestration-sla"}}